{
  "bodyHash": "f083f8d76d31bb7e",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_e2dc6d1b-ad5a-4e3d-b51d-210beac6dd12.PNG\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_be45e48e-a8ff-4cbc-980f-3acbf8109429.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>我一直想要一個<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">怪物擴展</span>，但許多生物與 Boss 模組都無法滿足我對<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">原版</span>的那種期待，因此我親自製作了这个模組！如果品質不夠完美，請見諒。我主要負責美術，但已經盡力了 :)（順帶一提，並非所有 MCreator 模組都只是換皮，不過我完全理解大家對於效能的擔憂）</p>\n<p>新增的大多數怪物會遵循傳統的怪物生成規則在所有生物群系中生成，但部分如 Shackled 限於特定生物群系，而 Boss 則需使用特定物品（Ominous Hex）才能召喚&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em>Discord 伺服器：<strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aFC5bjFkNC\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/c39DTtfGR </a></strong>（支援西班牙語與英語）</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>強烈建議安裝 JEI 或類似模組以查看合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>無法保證與其他模組的相容性，這取決於 MCreator</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>在最新版本中，所有怪物生成（spawnMob）以及部分功能（如病原體（doinfection）效果）均可透過遊戲規則（Gamerules）進行啟用或停用。相關 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em>遊戲規則清單</em></span> 可於本頁底部找到。</strong></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4979f0f0-8602-4fe3-bd74-0eb8c2778e12.png\"></p>\n<p>真的很感謝所有下載本模組的玩家。我非常歡迎任何反饋與建議，但如果是抱怨 MCreator 本身的問題，那我真的無能為力 :(</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><em>本頁面即為該模組的維基說明</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>生物與物品</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">物品</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_20223ae0-2e80-44ac-8407-7face5695521.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_590d259a-70dd-4a27-a7e1-d9623bec7640.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_008b7d76-7720-41fa-a957-914277f06352.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_aa8c7598-a036-4a59-8603-4720b0bd0d99.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a1b917c8-a7aa-4405-83f1-4e61a83f0bd4.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_30eb5796-6040-49db-b8ba-b0b57897bb49.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_7843b0ca-6075-4184-83a3-8a82de4d7a7e.PNG\"></p>\n<p>*感染效果預設為關閉，請將 DoInfection 遊戲規則設為 true 即可體驗</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_51f9f9b6-bfae-4ad8-bbd7-0864dbf497e9.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_6ea401e7-4672-49c3-9316-02a685a75af5.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a6d7f1c4-989f-4b5c-b8e5-8be3a5cb9b38.PNG\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_385051ff-df31-463c-9be8-a458d64e5ae5.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Terrantula</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ed980ce7-12c2-492a-9dd8-10c416d06d39.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Banshaa</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_fcdb590e-168e-4ba1-974f-19cfdce321da.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Scowl</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_e6e964a0-9251-4577-8172-d8df2d85fce1.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_a554fddf-d44a-4519-bc9e-539ba2627214.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Pioneer</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_dbb7fd1f-8f23-43a3-a0c1-7354ab22b4eb.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Reanimated</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_beeecf0a-627e-4e84-bc2c-c7dd1a0d1de5.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_5fbe44f6-a1d7-4def-89d1-057e4cb52d71.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">Allman</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_75303de9-4e13-4af3-bb6c-66a73c85da90.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Seer</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_b55002a8-65a0-4ff5-b723-6c846f29eeb6.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Patuti</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_85197dd7-d38a-4c1c-982e-127d2f9e3af2.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#34495e\">Mimic Beetles</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_53e21f5b-0764-4fdb-8825-f508e3755957.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Grimmsquito</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ead53c2c-d98e-42ab-86a7-264553fa9360.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Mimentis</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_ddc2bdbf-67f6-47dc-87e6-a5bbb8b18a76.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">與 Boss 相關的物品</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_f3607c23-27fb-4a5a-b541-8ffd13fb9aa1.PNG\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_cf3927bb-983a-49f3-abe7-0591df6c7bd0.PNG\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>遊戲規則：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>DoInfection（啟動不死病疫）</li>\n<li>DoReanimated（啟用透過儀式生成復生屍）</li>\n<li>DoBossRituals（啟用透過詛咒咒符召喚 Boss）</li>\n<li>ShackledSmoke（控制 Shackled 死亡時的煙霧特效）</li>\n<li>DoMimicBeetles（啟用礦石中的擬態甲蟲）</li>\n<li>SpawnSeer</li>\n<li>SpawnPatuti</li>\n<li>SpawnPioneer</li>\n<li>SpawnGrimmsquito</li>\n<li>SpawnShadow</li>\n<li>SpawnSupai</li>\n<li>SpawnScowl</li>\n<li>SpawnAllman</li>\n<li>SpawnTerrantula</li>\n<li>SpawnBanshaa</li>\n<li>SpawnShackled</li>\n<li>SpawnMimentis</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498334/description_1cda6c8b-73f5-472e-9618-a39461d2a80a.png\"></span></p>",
